{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14233","headline":"奉使西还早发小磵馆寄卢滁州迈 · 窦常","name":"奉使西还早发小磵馆寄卢滁州迈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野棠花覆地，山馆夜来阴。\n马蹟穿云去，鸡声出涧深。\n清风时偃草，久旱或爲霖。\n试与惸嫠话，犹坚借寇心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦常","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14233.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14233","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}